    {
      "id": "966728ab-34f1-4dfd-94ff-aaf1b96eb2d4",
      "title": "Theology 6 - 1: 10/20 Prayer Project (4)",
      "description": "Due: Tuesday, October 20.  Submission&#160;ON PAPER, HANDWRITTEN (NO SHOWBIE, NOTABILITY)  This project is a culminating activity that asks you to concentrate on what you have learned about prayer and putting it into action, in your daily life.&#160;&#160; There are four options that you can choose from: Option A:&#160; Sunday Mass Option B:&#160; The Examen Journal Option C:&#160; The Mysteries of My Life Option D:&#160; Lectio and Visio Divina Instructions: 1. Choose one of the four options. 2. Print out the Packet Corresponding with that option (Links Above) 3. Begin working on Project&#160;  You will only choose&#160; Each of the projects has multiple components and cannot be completed in just one day/night.&#160; Plan accordingly and begin your project early.&#160; You have two weeks (with two weekends) to complete your project.&#160; All work will be done on your own time (not in class) and a few options also involve your family&#8217;s participation. Important Reminders:  You will print out the pages of the project and handwrite your responses (in your best handwriting). No typing is allowed.&#160; Use a pencil or a pen on the actual hard copy.&#160; Do not do it in Showbie or Notability.&#160; A suggestion would be to make 2 copies of your chosen project and make one a draft. You will turn in the hardcopy of the project on the due date.&#160; (You will not submit it to Showbie.) Complete all components of the option that you choose.&#160; Be careful that you finish all aspects of your chosen project using complete sentences, especially in the reflection portions.",
      "due_date": "2026-10-20",
      "assigned": "2026-10-20",
      "due": "2026-10-20",
